{"7871":{"id":"7871","parent_id":"0","rank":"7871","active":"y","slug":"support-us-and-write-a-product-review","name":"Support Us and Write a Product Review","content_type":"html","content":"<p>Thank you for purchasing our products.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>To help other members better use the products, and share private feedback to us, please write an online review. It really helps us to better understand how you use the products, and also to add improvements\/features on future products.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>There are 2 ways to write the review;<\/p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>on the product page itself<\/li>\n\t<li>in the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arcooda.com\/account\/reviews\" target=\"_blank\">Review section<\/a> of the MyDashboard&nbsp;of your account<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n<p>Thank you for supporting Arcooda.<\/p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arcooda.com\/images\/page\/pageimage-18.jpg\" style=\"margin: 10px;\" \/><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arcooda.com\/images\/page\/pageimage-17.jpg\" style=\"width: 1373px; height: 502px;\" \/><\/p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.arcooda.com\/images\/page\/pageimage-17.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><input name=\"item_images[0][id]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"17\" \/><input name=\"item_images[0][page_id]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"7871\" \/><input name=\"item_images[0][chapter_id]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\" \/><\/a><\/p>","title":"","description":"","keywords":"","created_staff_id":"2","modified_staff_id":"2","created":"0000-00-00 00:00:00","modified":"2025-10-11 20:22:45","contact_form":"n","form_layout":"right","have_question":"n","create_time":null,"change_time":"1760174565","modified_unix":"1760174565","page_url":"\/support-us-and-write-a-product-review"}}